Node ID=200 plan
Text=Well then, a bit of candor is in order then. First, my real name is Guy Fawkes. Though I once opposed the royalty of England, I am now an agent of Queen Elizabeth, sent here on a mission of great import. The Queen herself ordered me to infiltrate the Spanish Armada and learn what secrets I can of their invasion plans.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me more.
Go to node ID=200 plan 2
Is Default Reply=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You said you once opposed England. What happened?
