------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=200 plan 2
Text=I have since enlisted with the Armada and gained the trust of the other sailors, but I have asked too many questions, and I believe some of the officers are getting suspicious, especially Captain Isabella. Unfortunately, she is one of the few to know the strategic plans of the Armada, since the Duke has turned over true tactical planning authority to her.
Should Have Voiceover=0

