Text=My story is...complicated. I supported a revolt to overthrow the Queen and formed a plot to detonate explosives below the Parliament building of London. Through the magic of her treacherous Druids, the Queen learned of the plot and imprisoned my fellow conspirators and my family in the Tower of London. Knowing of my talents, she offered this one chance to save my family and my friends, to infiltrate Barcelona and spy against the Spanish Armada. 
